# ---- Transcription on this server -------------------------------------------------------------
# The normal path: whisper.cpp runs here and the browser uploads to it. Needs three things — the
# whisper-cli binary, ffmpeg, and a model file. The Dockerfile sets all three up; for a local
# checkout, point these at your own.
#
# Looked for in order: these variables, then ./bin and ./models, then PATH.

# WHISPER_PATH=/usr/local/bin/whisper-cli
# FFMPEG_PATH=/usr/bin/ffmpeg

# Which model to load, from ./models. ggml-base.en.bin is quick; ggml-small.en-tdrz.bin is slower,
# more accurate, and the only one that marks where the speaker changes.
# WHISPER_MODEL=ggml-base.en.bin
# WHISPER_MODEL_PATH=/app/models/ggml-base.en.bin

# Threads whisper may use. Defaults to 4; the container sets it to the core count less one.
# WHISPER_THREADS=4

# ---- Pasted links -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Direct media links and podcast feeds need nothing. Everything else needs yt-dlp.
# YTDLP_PATH=/usr/bin/yt-dlp

# ---- Optional stand-in ------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Used only when whisper is not installed on this server. Leave unset to run on whisper alone;
# with neither, the browser transcribes instead and the app says so.
# DEEPGRAM_API_KEY=
# DEEPGRAM_MODEL=nova-3
